## 🎨 UI/UX DESIGN ARCHITECTURE

### Design System Foundation

#### 1. Color Palette
```
Primary Colors:
├─ Amazon Orange: #FF9900
├─ Dark Blue:      #232F3E
└─ Light Blue:     #37475A

Secondary Colors:
├─ Success Green:  #067D62
├─ Warning Yellow: #FFA724
├─ Error Red:      #C7511F
└─ Info Blue:      #007185

Neutral Colors:
├─ White:          #FFFFFF
├─ Light Gray:     #F3F3F3
├─ Medium Gray:    #E7E7E7
├─ Dark Gray:      #565959
└─ Black:          #0F1111
```

#### 2. Typography Scale
```
Font Family: 
├─ Primary: "Amazon Ember", Arial, sans-serif
└─ Mono: "Courier New", monospace

Sizes:
├─ h1: 32px / 2rem    (Bold)     - Page Titles
├─ h2: 28px / 1.75rem (Bold)     - Section Headers
├─ h3: 24px / 1.5rem  (SemiBold) - Card Titles
├─ h4: 20px / 1.25rem (SemiBold) - Subsections
├─ body: 14px / 0.875rem (Regular) - Body Text
├─ small: 12px / 0.75rem (Regular) - Captions
└─ tiny: 10px / 0.625rem (Regular) - Labels
```

#### 3. Spacing System (8px Grid)
```
xs:  4px   (0.25rem)
sm:  8px   (0.5rem)
md:  16px  (1rem)
lg:  24px  (1.5rem)
xl:  32px  (2rem)
2xl: 48px  (3rem)
3xl: 64px  (4rem)
```

#### 4. Component Library
```
Atoms (Basic Building Blocks):
├─ Button (Primary, Secondary, Tertiary)
├─ Input (Text, Email, Password, Number)
├─ Icon (Lucide React)
├─ Badge (Status, Count)
├─ Avatar
└─ Spinner

Molecules (Component Combinations):
├─ SearchBar
├─ ProductCard
├─ CartItem
├─ OrderCard
├─ StatCard
└─ NotificationToast

Organisms (Complex Components):
├─ Header (with Auth, Cart, Search)
├─ Footer
├─ ProductGrid
├─ CategoryNav
├─ OrderTimeline
└─ SellerSidebar

Templates (Page Layouts):
├─ MainLayout (Header + Content + Footer)
├─ DashboardLayout (Sidebar + Content)
└─ CheckoutLayout (Steps + Summary)
```

