## 🎭 UX PATTERNS & INTERACTIONS

### 1. Micro-interactions

```
Button States:
├─ Default:    bg-[#FF9900] 
├─ Hover:      bg-[#E88B00] + scale(1.02)
├─ Active:     bg-[#D17B00] + scale(0.98)
├─ Disabled:   bg-gray-300 + opacity-50
└─ Loading:    Spinner animation

Card Hover:
├─ Shadow:     elevation 0 → 8px
├─ Transform:  translateY(0) → translateY(-4px)
└─ Transition: 200ms ease-out

Input Focus:
├─ Border:     gray → blue (2px)
├─ Shadow:     0 → 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,153,0,0.2)
└─ Transition: 150ms ease
```

### 2. Loading States

```
Page Load:
┌─────────────────┐
│ ┌─────────────┐ │
│ │ ▓▓▓▓▓▓░░░░░ │ │ Skeleton Loader
│ │ ▓▓▓░░░░░░░░ │ │
│ │ ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓░░░░ │ │
│ └─────────────┘ │
└─────────────────┘

Infinite Scroll:
[Products...]
[Spinner]
[Load more products...]
```

