## 🔄 STATE MANAGEMENT ARCHITECTURE

```
Global State (Context/Redux):
├─ User Authentication
│  ├─ user: { id, email, name, role }
│  ├─ isAuthenticated: boolean
│  └─ token: string
│
├─ Shopping Cart
│  ├─ items: Product[]
│  ├─ totalItems: number
│  ├─ totalAmount: number
│  └─ actions: { add, remove, update }
│
├─ Notifications
│  ├─ toasts: Toast[]
│  ├─ realTimeOrders: Order[]
│  └─ webSocketStatus: 'connected' | 'disconnected'
│
└─ UI State
   ├─ theme: 'light' | 'dark'
   ├─ sidebarOpen: boolean
   └─ modalStack: Modal[]

Local State (Component):
├─ Form inputs
├─ UI toggles
├─ Temporary data
└─ Animation states
```

