## 🎬 ANIMATION GUIDELINES

### Motion Design Principles
```
Duration Guidelines:
├─ Micro: 100-200ms (hovers, clicks)
├─ Small: 200-300ms (tooltips, dropdowns)
├─ Medium: 300-500ms (modals, slides)
└─ Large: 500-800ms (page transitions)

Easing Functions:
├─ Ease-out: UI appearing
├─ Ease-in: UI disappearing
├─ Ease-in-out: Moving between states
└─ Spring: Playful interactions

Examples:
.fade-in {
  animation: fadeIn 300ms ease-out;
}

@keyframes fadeIn {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

.slide-in {
  animation: slideIn 400ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}
```

