```
As you type:
├─ Instant suggestions
├─ Category filtering
├─ Recent searches
├─ Popular products
└─ Typo correction
```

### 3. Cart Persistence
```
Cart saved:
├─ LocalStorage backup
├─ Sync on login
├─ Expire after 30 days
└─ Merge guest + user carts
```

